---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy"
  description="Privacy information for this static portfolio: no cookies, no tracking, only a cookie-free visit counter."
>
  <section class="page-header">
    <h1 class="page-header__title">Privacy</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="privacy prose">
    <p>
      This site is static: it doesn't use cookies or tracking tools, and it doesn't collect personal data
      through forms.
    </p>
    <p>
      To count visits, the site uses
      <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GoatCounter</a>, a privacy-friendly
      analytics service that sets no cookies and doesn't build profiles of visitors. It records only
      anonymous, aggregate data such as the page viewed, the referrer, and your browser, screen size and
      country. See
      <a href="https://www.goatcounter.com/help#gdpr" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GoatCounter's GDPR notes</a>
      for details.
    </p>
    <p>
      The only thing stored on your device is your theme choice (day or night), saved in your browser's
      local storage so the site remembers it. It never leaves your browser.
    </p>
    <p>
      GitHub Pages, the hosting service for this site, may log visitors' IP addresses as part of its
      standard access logs. See
      <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub's Privacy Statement</a>
      for details.
    </p>
    <p>
      The data controller is {site.name}, reachable at <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you write to me by email, I use your address and the content of your message only to reply,
      and I don't share them with anyone.
    </p>
    <p>
      Under the GDPR (Articles 15–22) you have the right to access, correct or delete your personal data,
      to restrict or object to its processing, and to data portability. To exercise these rights, write to
      the address above. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with the Italian Data Protection
      Authority (<a href="https://www.garanteprivacy.it" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Garante per la protezione dei dati personali</a>).
    </p>
    <p class="privacy__updated">Last updated: November 14, 2026</p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .privacy {
    padding: 0 var(--gutter);
  }

  .privacy a {
    color: var(--accent-text);
  }

  .privacy__updated {
    opacity: 0.7;
    font-size: 0.9em;
  }
</style>
